    text: "@scene_meta_pov: Geralt-centered third person"
  - line: 14
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_participants: Geralt; Oreck; Companion Protocol / Luminaire; Five Mikas; Ledger Auditor"
  - line: 15
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_focus: River delivery, Forgotten Valley entry, discovery of the null-state Ghost Spire, lake/island approach, Five materialization, threshold ritual, Auditor attack, 80% Anchor assimilation, coherent Luminaire reassembly, and contract nullification."
  - line: 16
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_boundary_evidence: Major destination reset after the river escape."
  - line: 17
    type: narration
    text: "Valley arrival through foreclosure resolution is one uninterrupted operation without a meaningful time, POV, location, or dramatic reset."
  - line: 18
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_geralt_state: Reaches approximately 80% Anchor symbiosis, suffers bleeding and cortical overload, remains physically Geralt, and also experiences identification with the Spire; Faraxar memory is not restored."
  - line: 19
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_dragon_mail_terminal_state: Stage 1 remains the highest named stage."
  - line: 20
    type: narration
    text: "Armor is operational but damaged/structurally compromised; Chapter 048's cracked plates and bent left wing were never repaired on-page, and the threshold adds \"structural integrity compromised.\""
  - line: 21
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_flight_capability: No wing deployment or sustained flight occurs."
  - line: 22
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_zaron_state: Zaron's last-established distinct internal consciousness remains unexplained after years of silence; Chapter 044 physical embodiment also remains unresolved."
  - line: 23
    type: narration
    text: "Armor independence and defensive reactions are not attributed to him."
  - line: 24
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_applicator_state: Active head-Applicator remains functionally distinct, warns during cortical overload, reports symbiosis, and produces visual-processing errors."
  - line: 25
    type: narration
    text: "Relation to Chapter 039's claimed real occipital Applicator remains unresolved."
  - line: 26
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_channel_distinction: Applicator, Dragon Mail/armor, and Companion/Luminaire are three distinct functional channels at the threshold."
  - line: 27
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_luminaire_state: Coherent Luminaire returns in 049.7 through Ghost Spire reassembly and Geralt's Anchor assimilation."
  - line: 28
    type: narration
    text: "She becomes conversationally whole and persists as a richer silver-thread presence; the exact Echo → Companion Protocol → coherent Luminaire transition remains terminologically underexplained."
  - line: 29
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_luminara_vessel_state: Geralt and the Ghost Spire become the present reassembly medium, but the Chapter 041 liberated physical/material vessel remains unaccounted for."
  - line: 30
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_protocol_key_state: Completely unmentioned and unused; no consumption by the Ghost Spire is inferred."
  - line: 31
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_sound_fragment_state: The Ghost Spire invokes \"SOUND\" without any staged physical delivery of the Forest or Plains Sound fragments."
  - line: 32
    type: narration
    text: "No off-page installation is invented."
  - line: 33
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_fragment_numbering: Third/Fourth Fragment problem remains unresolved."
  - line: 34
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_five_state: The Five materialize as elemental ideals, guard the threshold, expend themselves, collapse/de-cohere into base elements, and require time to re-cohere."
  - line: 35
    type: narration
    text: "Remission Chambers, original bodies, Affinity Cores, awakening, and first conscious acts remain unclarified; they are not identified as Chapter 043's future five."
  - line: 36
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_five_/_250_state: Chapter 049 partially re-separates the Five from the 250, but does not repair the contaminated \"unmade/remade\" Five history inherited from Chapter 048."
  - line: 37
    type: narration
    text: "The original 249-versus-250 discrepancy remains unresolved."
  - line: 38
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_faraxar_memory_state: The threshold memory is Mika-related, not recovery of Geralt's Heart of Faraxar autobiographical memory."
  - line: 39
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_oreck_state: Alive, armorless, cleaver-equipped, augmentations functioning, and guarding Geralt."
  - line: 40
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_karvex_/_ledger_state: Karvex does not return and is not established dead."
  - line: 41
    type: narration
    text: "He is characterized as a minor function."
  - line: 42
    type: narration
    text: "The higher Auditor's foreclosure is voided, the contract is nullified, and the Ledger is declared no further threat under the chapter's present claim."
  - line: 43
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_federation_clocks: Original 48-hour compliance deadline remains unresolved; the Auditor is not demonstrated Federation enforcement."
  - line: 44
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_node_gamma_state: No return and no twelve-shard outcome."
  - line: 45
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_sath'rak_state: Warning remains abandoned/unresolved."
  - line: 46
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_time-travel_state: Historical projections, chroniton effects, and Ghost Spire phenomena establish no branch, rewrite, loop, parallel world, erased future, or preserved future."
  - line: 47
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_hidden_interval: Spire nulling/history, missing fragment delivery, Five recovery route, old armor repair, and original-vessel disposition remain unshown."
  - line: 48
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_chronological_overlap: The Spire projects the Hub stand, Mika's protocol work, the 250, the Five, Oreck, and Geralt as historical evidence; these are representations, not duplicate occurrences."
  - line: 49
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_presentation: destination discovery → transformation ritual → defensive battle"
  - line: 50
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_cutscene_purpose: Reassemble coherent Luminaire, defeat the Auditor's foreclosure, and nullify the Ledger contract."
  - line: 51
    type: narration
    text: "@contract: engain.scene_text_packet.v1"
  - line: 52
    type: scene_header
    text: "---"
